{"id": "139936", "name": "מציאת גרעין ותמונה העתקה לינארית - פולינומים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "randvervect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "randvervectnonzero", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_prohib(-k,k,[0]),n))"}, {"name": "randhorvect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "matrix(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "dezero", "params": ["vec", "n", "k"], "body": "if (zeromatrixp(vec)) then randvervectnonzero(n,k) else vec"}, {"name": "dezerolst", "params": ["veclst", "k"], "body": "map(lambda([vec], dezero(vec, length(vec),k)), veclst)"}, {"name": "matrify", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "block([mat:matrix([])], for i:1 thru length(veclst) do(mat:addcol(mat,veclst[i])),mat)"}, {"name": "dependentvects", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst))<length(veclst))"}, {"name": "inSpan", "params": ["veclst1", "veclst2"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst1)) = rank(matrify(append(veclst1,veclst2))))"}, {"name": "vectToPoly", "params": ["vect"], "body": "block([poly:0], for i:0 thru (length(vect)-1) do(poly: poly + x^i*vect[i+1,1]),poly)"}, {"name": "polyToVect", "params": ["poly"], "body": "transpose(rest(coeff_list(x^n+poly,x),-1))"}, {"name": "alltrue", "params": ["pred", "lst"], "body": "emptyp(delete(true,map(pred, lst)))"}, {"name": "coin", "params": ["i"], "body": "is(rand(3)=0)", "array": true}, {"name": "inImT", "params": ["v"], "body": "inSpan(imageVecs,[v])"}, {"name": "inKerT", "params": ["v"], "body": "zeromatrixp(TII.v)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה העתקה לינארית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T:\\mathbb{R}_{\\leq 2}[x]\\to\\mathbb{R}_{\\leq 2}[x]\\)</span> המקיימת:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[T(p_1)={{CT:0}}\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[T(p_2)={{CT:1}}\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[T(p_3)={{CT:2}}\\]</p><p>עבור הפולינומים</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[p_1 = {{CT:3}}\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[p_2= {{CT:4}}\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[p_3 = {{CT:5}}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו <b>בסיס</b> לתמונה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T\\)</span> שנסמנו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B_{\\text{Im}}\\)</span>. מצאו בסיס לגרעין של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T\\)</span> שנסמנו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B_{\\ker}\\)</span>. הזינו תשובתכם כרשימת פולינומים.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(B_{\\text{Im}}= \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(B_{\\ker}= \\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הערה: בתבנית התשובה מופיע פולינום אחד. במידת הצורך הורידו/הוסיפו עוד פולינומים לבסיס.</p><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הזנת קלט: אם אתם סבורים ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B =\\{ {{CT:6}}, {{CT:7}} \\}\\)</span>, הזינו במקום המתאים את הרשימה: <code dir=\"ltr\">[x^2, 3*x+5]</code></p><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">אם אתם סבורים ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Ker(T)=\\{0\\}\\)</span>, הזינו במקום המתאים את הרשימה הריקה: <code dir=\"ltr\">[]</code></p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 60, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "[a+b*x+c*x^2]", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 60, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "[a+b*x+c*x^2]", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "varlist1: listofvars(ans1);\nvarlist2: listofvars(ans2);\ngoodvars: is((varlist1=[x] or varlist1=[]) and (varlist2 = [x] or varlist2 = []));\n\ndeglqn(pol):= is(hipow(pol,x)<n);\ngooddegs: is(alltrue(deglqn,ans1) and alltrue(deglqn,ans2));\n\nvalidInput: goodvars and gooddegs;\n\nansIm: if (validInput) then map(polyToVect,ans1) else [];\nansKer: if (validInput) then map(polyToVect,ans2) else [];\n\nindIm: not dependentvects(ansIm);\ninspanIm: alltrue(inImT,ansIm);\nspansIm: is(inspanIm and rank(matrify(ansIm))=dimImT);\n\nindKer: not dependentvects(ansKer);\ninspanKer: alltrue(inKerT,ansKer);\nspansKer: is(inspanKer and rank(matrify(ansKer))=dimKerT);\n\ngoodIm: indIm and spansIm;\ngoodKer: indKer and spansKer;\nallgood: is(goodIm and goodKer);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "goodvars", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">בתשובתך מופיעים משתנים פרט ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "gooddegs", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">בתשובתך מופיעים פולינומים ממעלה גבוהה מדי.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "indIm", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך שגויה. הפולינומים שהזנת כבסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Im(T)\\)</span> תלויים לינארית.</div>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "inspanIm", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך שגויה. לא כל הפולינומים שהזנת כבסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Im(T)\\)</span> שייכים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Im(T)\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "spansIm", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt1-5-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt1-5-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך שגויה. הפולינומים שהזנת כבסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Im(T)\\)</span> אינם פורשים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Im(T)\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 5, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "indKer", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 6, "answernote": "prt1-6-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 6, "answernote": "prt1-6-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך שגויה. הפולינומים שהזנת כבסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Ker(T)\\)</span> תלויים לינארית.</div>"}}, {"name": 6, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "inspanKer", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 7, "answernote": "prt1-7-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 9, "answernote": "prt1-7-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך שגויה. לא כל הפולינומים שהזנת כבסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Ker(T)\\)</span> שייכים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Ker(T)\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 7, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "spansKer", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 8, "answernote": "prt1-8-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 9, "answernote": "prt1-8-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך שגויה. הפולינומים שהזנת כבסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Ker(T)\\)</span> אינם פורשים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Ker(T)\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 8, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "goodKer", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 9, "answernote": "prt1-9-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הזנת בסיס מתאים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Ker(T)\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 9, "answernote": "prt1-9-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 9, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "goodIm", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-10-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הזנת בסיס מתאים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Im(T)\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-10-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["IIB", "TBI", "TII", "baseIm", "baseKer", "baseVecs", "dimImT", "dimKerT", "imageVecs", "k", "n", "polyBase", "polyImage"], "nvariants": 50}